          "type": "explanation",
          "text": "Memory: Questions lead with the helper. Always.",
          "voice_line": "Memory trick. In English, questions are led by the helper verb. DO, DID, DOES, IS, ARE, WAS, WERE, HAVE, HAS, WILL, CAN, SHOULD. These helpers always march to the front of a question.",
